# Configuration for slurm/train_gan.sh 128, read when the job starts.
#
# The first configuration (hinge loss, spectral normalisation, translation and
# cutout DiffAugment) collapsed on OASIS in the smoke test, job 590977: by step
# 1,000 all 64 progress samples were one brain, after the discriminator's scores
# for real and generated slices both sank to zero at step 300 and stayed there.
#
# Provisional, until slurm/sweep_gan.sh has compared the alternatives: the
# non-saturating logistic loss with an R1 penalty on real images and no spectral
# normalisation (Mescheder et al., 2018), translation only.
--loss logistic
--r1-gamma 10
--no-spectral-norm
--diffaugment translation
--lr-g 2e-4
--lr-d 2e-4
--beta2 0.99
